{"book":"II Chronicles","chapter":7,"entries":[{"id":11325,"title":"II Chronicles 7:1","segments":["¶Now when Solomon had made an end of praying, the fire came down from heaven, and consumed the burnt offering and the sacrifices; and the glory of the LORD filled the house."],"ref":"II Chronicles 7:1","verse":1,"words":[{"text":"¶Now when Solomon","strong":"H8010"},{"text":" had made an end","strong":"H3615"},{"text":" of praying","strong":"H6419"},{"text":", the fire","strong":"H784"},{"text":" came down","strong":"H3381"},{"text":" from heaven","strong":"H8064"},{"text":", and consumed","strong":"H398"},{"text":" the burnt offering","strong":"H5930"},{"text":" and the sacrifices","strong":"H2077"},{"text":"; and the glory","strong":"H3519"},{"text":" of the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" filled","strong":"H4390"},{"text":" the house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":11326,"title":"II Chronicles 7:2","segments":["And the priests could not enter into the house of the LORD, because the glory of the LORD had filled the LORD'S house."],"ref":"II Chronicles 7:2","verse":2,"words":[{"text":"And the priests","strong":"H3548"},{"text":" could","strong":"H3201"},{"text":" not enter","strong":"H935"},{"text":" into the house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":" of the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":", because the glory","strong":"H3519"},{"text":" of the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" had filled","strong":"H4390"},{"text":" the LORD'S","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":11327,"title":"II Chronicles 7:3","segments":["And when all the children of Israel saw how the fire came down, and the glory of the LORD upon the house, they bowed themselves with their faces to the ground upon the pavement, and worshipped, and praised the LORD, [saying], For [he is] good; for his mercy [endureth] for ever."],"ref":"II Chronicles 7:3","verse":3,"words":[{"text":"And when all the children","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"tex