{"text":" a solemn assembly","strong":"H6116"},{"text":": for they kept","strong":"H6213"},{"text":" the dedication","strong":"H2598"},{"text":" of the altar","strong":"H4196"},{"text":" seven","strong":"H7651"},{"text":" days","strong":"H3117"},{"text":", and the feast","strong":"H2282"},{"text":" seven","strong":"H7651"},{"text":" days","strong":"H3117"},{"text":". {a solemn...: Heb. a restraint}"}]},{"id":11334,"title":"II Chronicles 7:10","segments":["And on the three and twentieth day of the seventh month he sent the people away into their tents, glad and merry in heart for the goodness that the LORD had shewed unto David, and to Solomon, and to Israel his people."],"ref":"II Chronicles 7:10","verse":10,"words":[{"text":"And on the three","strong":"H7969"},{"text":" and twentieth","strong":"H6242"},{"text":" day","strong":"H3117"},{"text":" of the seventh","strong":"H7637"},{"text":" month","strong":"H2320"},{"text":" he sent","strong":"H7971"},{"text":" the people","strong":"H5971"},{"text":" away","strong":"H7971"},{"text":" into their tents","strong":"H168"},{"text":", glad","strong":"H8056"},{"text":" and merry","strong":"H2896"},{"text":" in heart","strong":"H3820"},{"text":" for the goodness","strong":"H2896"},{"text":" that the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" had shewed","strong":"H6213"},{"text":" unto David","strong":"H1732"},{"text":", and to Solomon","strong":"H8010"},{"text":", and to Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":" his people","strong":"H5971"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":11335,"title":"II Chronicles 7:11","segments":["Thus Solomon finished the house of the LORD, and the king's house: and all that came into Solomon's heart to make in the house of the LORD, and in his own house, he prosperously effected."],"ref":"II Chronicles 7:11","verse":11,"words":[{"text":"Thus Solomon","strong":"H8010"},{"text":" finished","strong":"H3615"},{"text":" the house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":" of the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":", and the king's","strong":"H4428