om their wicked ways; then will I hear from heaven, and will forgive their sin, and will heal their land. {which...: Heb. upon whom my name is called}"],"ref":"II Chronicles 7:14","verse":14,"words":[{"text":"If my people","strong":"H5971"},{"text":", which are called","strong":"H7121"},{"text":" by my name","strong":"H8034"},{"text":", shall humble","strong":"H3665"},{"text":" themselves, and pray","strong":"H6419"},{"text":", and seek","strong":"H1245"},{"text":" my face","strong":"H6440"},{"text":", and turn","strong":"H7725"},{"text":" from their wicked","strong":"H7451"},{"text":" ways","strong":"H1870"},{"text":"; then will I hear","strong":"H8085"},{"text":" from heaven","strong":"H8064"},{"text":", and will forgive","strong":"H5545"},{"text":" their sin","strong":"H2403"},{"text":", and will heal","strong":"H7495"},{"text":" their land","strong":"H776"},{"text":". {which...: Heb. upon whom my name is called}"}]},{"id":11339,"title":"II Chronicles 7:15","segments":["Now mine eyes shall be open, and mine ears attent unto the prayer [that is made] in this place. {unto...: Heb. to the prayer of this place}"],"ref":"II Chronicles 7:15","verse":15,"words":[{"text":"Now mine eyes","strong":"H5869"},{"text":" shall be open","strong":"H6605"},{"text":", and mine ears","strong":"H241"},{"text":" attent","strong":"H7183"},{"text":" unto the prayer","strong":"H8605"},{"text":" [that is made] in this place","strong":"H4725"},{"text":". {unto...: Heb. to the prayer of this place}"}]},{"id":11340,"title":"II Chronicles 7:16","segments":["For now have I chosen and sanctified this house, that my name may be there for ever: and mine eyes and mine heart shall be there perpetually."],"ref":"II Chronicles 7:16","verse":16,"words":[{"text":"For now have I chosen","strong":"H977"},{"text":" and sanctified","strong":"H6942"},{"text":" this house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":", that my name","strong":"H8034"},{"text":" may be there for","strong":"H5704"},{"text":" ever","strong":"H5769"},{"text":": and mine eyes","strong":"H5869"},{"text":" and mine heart","strong":"H3820"},{"text":" shall be there perpetually","strong":"H3117"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":11341,"title":"II Chronicles 7:17","segments":["And as for thee, if thou wilt walk before me, as David thy father walked, and do according to all that I have commanded thee, and shalt observe my statutes and my judgments;"],"ref":"II Chronicles 7:17","verse":17,"words":[{"text":"And as for thee, if thou wilt walk","strong":"H3212"},{"text":" before","strong":"H6440"},{"text":" me, as David","strong":"H1732"},{"text":" thy father","strong":"H1"},{"text":" walked","strong":"H1980"},{"text":", and do","strong":"H6213"},{"text":" according to all that I have commanded","strong":"H6680"},{"text":" thee, and shalt observe","strong":"H8104"},{"text":" my statutes","strong":"H2706"},{"text":" and my judgments","strong":"H4941"},{"text":";"}]},{"id":11342,"title":"II Chronicles 7:18","segments":["Then will I stablish the throne of thy kingdom, according as I have covenanted with David thy father, saying, There shall not fail thee a man [to be] ruler in Israel. {There...: Heb. There shall not be cut off to thee}"],"ref":"II Chronicles 7:18","verse":18,"words":[{"text":"Then will I stablish","strong":"H6965"},{"text":" the throne","strong":"H3678"},{"text":" of thy kingdom","strong":"H4438"},{"text":", according as I have covenanted","strong":"H3772"},{"text":" with David","strong":"H1732"},{"text":" thy father","strong":"H1"},{"text":", saying","strong":"H559"},{"text":", There shall not fail","strong":"H3772"},{"text":" thee a man","strong":"H376"},{"text":" [to be] ruler","strong":"H4910"},{"text":" in Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":". {There...: Heb. There shall not be cut off to thee}"}]},{"id":11343,"title":"II Chronicles 7:19","segments":["But if ye turn away, and forsake my statutes and my commandments, which I have set before you, and shall go and serve other gods, and worship them;"],"ref":"II Chronicles 7:19","verse":19,"words":[{"text":"But if ye turn away","strong":"H7725"},{"text":", and forsake","strong":"H5800"},{"text":" my statutes","strong":"H2708"},{"text":" and my commandments","strong":"H4687"},{"text":", which I have set","strong":"H5414"},{"text":" before","strong":"H6440"},{"text":" you, and shall go","strong":"H1980"},{"text":" and serve","strong":"H5647"},{"text":" other","strong":"H312"},{"text":" gods","strong":"H430"},{"text":", and worship","strong":"H7812"},{"text":" them;"}]},{"id":11344,"title":"II Chronicles 7:20","segments":["Then will I pluck them up by the roots out of my land which I have given them; and this house, which I have sanctified for my name, will I cast out of my sight, and will make it [to be] a proverb and a byword among all nations."],"ref":"II Chronicles 7:20","verse":20,"words":[{"text":"Then will I pluck them up by the roots","strong":"H5428"},{"text":" out of my land","strong":"H127"},{"text":" which I have given","strong":"H5414"},{"text":" them; and this house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":", which I have sanctified","strong":"H6942"},{"text":" for my name","strong":"H8034"},{"text":", will I cast out","strong":"H7993"},{"text":" of my sight","strong":"H6440"},{"text":", and will make","strong":"H5414"},{"text":" it [to be] a proverb","strong":"H4912"},{"text":" and a byword","strong":"H8148"},{"text":" among all nations","strong":"H5971"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":11345,"title":"II Chronicles 7:21","segments":["And this house, which is high, shall be an astonishment to every one that passeth by it; so that he shall say, Why hath the LORD done thus unto this land, and unto this house?"],"ref":"II Chronicles 7:21","verse":21,"words":[{"text":"And this house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":", which is high","strong":"H5945"},{"text":", shall be an astonishment","strong":"H8074"},{"text":" to every one that passeth","strong":"H5674"},{"text":" by it; so that he shall say","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Why hath the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" done","strong":"H6213"},{"text":" thus unto this land","strong":"H776"},{"text":", and unto this house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":"?"}]},{"id":11346,"title":"II Chronicles 7:22","segments":["And it shall be answered, Because they forsook the LORD God of their fathers, which brought them forth out of the land of Egypt, and laid hold on other gods, and worshipped them, and served them: therefore hath he brought all this evil upon them."],"ref":"II Chronicles 7:22","verse":22,"words":[{"text":"And it shall be answered","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Because they forsook","strong":"H5800"},{"text":" the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" God","strong":"H430"},{"text":" of their fathers","strong":"H1"},{"text":", which brought them forth","strong":"H3318"},{"text":" out of the land","strong":"H776"},{"text":" of Egypt","strong":"H4714"},{"text":", and laid hold","strong":"H2388"},{"text":" on other","strong":"H312"},{"text":" gods","strong":"H430"},{"text":", and worshipped","strong":"H7812"},{"text":" them, and served","strong":"H5647"},{"text":" them: therefore hath he brought","strong":"H935"},{"text":" all this evil","strong":"H7451"},{"text":" upon them."}]}]}
